    "testimonials_bPAxbw": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_J4KxCC": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": " Ayad Tassabehji (General Manager)",
            "text": "<p><em>The AIWO experience was a true eye-opener to the state of my health. The diagnostics and care provided were beyond what I expected, and I especially enjoyed the physio and spa-like services in the comfort of a five-star hotel. It felt more like a holiday retreat with lasting benefits.</em></p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_mDNQRF": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": " Shlok Srivastava (Influencer & Entrepreneur)",
            "text": "<p><em>I wanted to experience what's on the bleeding edge of bio and health technologies and reverse my biological age. I’m overwhelmed by what I got from AIWO. Myofascial release fixed my posture and made me feel so much better.</em></p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_BYX7YM": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Sandra (Adelaide, Australia)",
            "text": "<p><em>I was referred to AIWO Healthcation by Self-Decode as I was interested in longevity and maintaining my health as I age. The experience exceeded my expectations by a thousand percent! Staff were amazing, and nothing was too much trouble. From comprehensive health tests to gourmet cuisine and expert support, I felt completely looked after. As a single woman, it felt safe and empowering. I highly recommend it to anyone seeking a thorough and supportive wellness retreat.</em></p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_YqTdmw": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": " Bob (Netherlands)",
            "text": "<p><em>Without medicine, I'm now free of diabetes. We discovered many things here that previous tests in my country had missed. Everything is above expectations.</em></p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_38rzhh": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon_star": "5_star",
            "custom_icon": "",
            "title": "Rola Tassabehji (Yoga Instructor)",
            "text": "<p><em>As a yoga instructor and lifelong wellness enthusiast, I was drawn to AIWO’s offering, using the latest science-backed, deep diagnostics for preventive care. I discovered health issues that my annual health checks never picked up. The empathy and attention at AIWO make me feel 'safe' health-wise and in the hands of people who sincerely care about my health.</em></p>",
            "author": "",
            "author_note": "",
            "product": ""
          }
        }
      },
